# WP Stories

A free, GPL-2.0-or-later Elementor widget for Instagram-style story galleries.

## Features

- Avatar story circles with customizable gradients and layout.
- Full-screen story viewer with timed slides, tap controls and swipe gestures.
- Desktop user previews with a smooth cube-style transition between users.
- Native WordPress update notices powered by public GitHub Releases, with a manual check link on the Plugins screen.
- English source strings and Spanish (`es_ES`) translations.

## Requirements

- WordPress 5.9 or later
- PHP 7.4 or later
- Elementor installed and activated

## Installing and updating

Install the release ZIP from the [Releases page](https://github.com/prototype-ix/wp-stories/releases). After that, WordPress will detect newer GitHub Releases in **Dashboard → Updates** and can update the plugin normally.

Each release asset is packaged with a `wp-stories/` top-level directory so WordPress preserves the plugin folder during automatic updates.

